		{"id":"5ad30a19696e6f84","type":"text","text":"Generating model from zero","x":2131,"y":-974,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"38ebffac768581a1","type":"text","text":"Example: terrain generation\n1. Create plane\n2. Subdivide plane\n3. Displace plane using noise\n\nOR\n1. Create cube\n2. Voxelize cube (including its volume)\n3. Assign each voxel certain noise value\n4. Remove voxels which have certain value","x":1971,"y":-762,"width":570,"height":340},
		{"id":"c48c4d447dbbb68f","type":"text","text":"Example:\n1. Create or import model\n2. Sample model geometry for points (scatter/distribute points) on surface\n3. Instance another model on points","x":2131,"y":-1742,"width":334,"height":200},
		{"id":"b265abd975bee43e","type":"text","text":"Additive","x":2173,"y":-1448,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"dff3855b3c03ac6f","type":"text","text":"Example: \n1. Create simple shape (e.g., cube) model or import model\n2. Perform Voronoi Tessellation on model - now voronoi cells are available\n3. Create curve \n4. Remove (subtract) cells which are close to curve","x":2895,"y":-1850,"width":405,"height":260},
