		{"id":"74a7b5113ed13ef9","type":"text","text":"Vehicles (cars/ships/airplanes/spaceships): \n* vehicles are made modular (each module is modelled separately) and assembly is done procedurally","x":13405,"y":-1094,"width":359,"height":160,"color":"1"},
