		{"id":"9f209aef3937011c","type":"text","text":"* `obj/` network contains only geometry with colors\n* Open Solaris Desktop preset\n* Select `stage/` network and link geometry, create materials, add lights and cameras and Karma renderer","x":21322,"y":3950,"width":305,"height":251},
		{"id":"fa4de80543747baf","type":"text","text":"Geometry","x":19830,"y":1079,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a76b4cf4ebc12b75","type":"text","text":"Computer Aided Design","x":17440,"y":-1789,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bb7193edf7fc6cd8","type":"text","text":"Parametric Design","x":16767,"y":-1789,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"08c8c1e96a989fc7","type":"text","text":"Algorithmic Art","x":17100,"y":-1671,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cce782dabdbd9568","type":"text","text":"Algorithmic Design","x":17440,"y":-1671,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f79205a302f89766","type":"link","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCptKvK-9Hg","x":17114,"y":-1489,"width":518,"height":287},
		{"id":"b213757eaba7d7d9","type":"text","text":"File -> Save as...","x":20513,"y":-591,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"10052ac63938dde1","type":"text","text":"File -> New Project...","x":20513,"y":-733,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f85d3fb0a9735dc5","type":"text","text":"Import 3D models using `geo/` or `geo/obj/` network\n\nSupported file formats: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/io/formats/index.html\n* OBJ\n* FBX\n* GLTF\n* USD\n* Alembic\n","x":20841,"y":977,"width":374,"height":325},
		{"id":"afd5d3c5b4287f0e","type":"text","text":"Computational Design","x":16767,"y":-1671,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d0d5871f1ec363fd","type":"text","text":"Generative ML","x":17766,"y":-1789,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e988a32fa74f90c8","type":"text","text":"Generative Art/Design","x":17766,"y":-1671,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6005c3476627ec69","type":"text","text":"Mesh","x":19470,"y":1000,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"53cc2e1f2ed1b7d7","type":"link","url":"https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/basics/config.html#common-ui-customizations","x":19094,"y":429,"width":750,"height":400},
		{"id":"761ebe05c9f757e7","type":"link","url":"https://www.blender.org/","x":18874,"y":4170,"width":366,"height":380},
		{"id":"7854ed9dabc909ff","type":"text","text":"Text\n\nNow, we will quickly go through basic pipeline for modeling, export and rendering.\n\nFirst, we will create new Houdini project and file.\n\nThen, we will import existing 3D model from sites like Polyhaven.\n\nExample procedural operations will be performed on geometry.\n\nFor rendering, we will use Solaris desktop via `stage/` network. There we will link 3D model, add material, light, camera and karma renderer.\n\nFor exporting, we will use file node in `obj/geo/` network.\n\n\n\n","x":18761,"y":7360,"width":809,"height":374,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"473a9bd840247102","type":"text","text":"Curves/Parametric Surfaces","x":19470,"y":1060,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0311a6623fa80a03","type":"text","text":"Export for other engines/DCCs using `obj/`, `obj/geo/` or `out/` networks.\n\nSupported file formats: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/io/formats/index.html\n* OBJ\n* FBX\n* GLTF\n* USD\n* Alembic","x":19165,"y":3641,"width":386,"height":352},
		{"id":"a73adb58e65463d3","type":"file","file":"Images/Intro/HoudiniFirstSteps/2_Geo.jpg","x":19911,"y":1524,"width":1227,"height":662},
		{"id":"84d1b4adf6dedae9","type":"link","url":"https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/composite/index.html","x":20034,"y":6664,"width":886,"height":400},
		{"id":"342839180e6bd3de","type":"link","url":"https://unity.com/products/unity-engine","x":19274,"y":4170,"width":400,"height":380},
		{"id":"08c52c99b8216638","type":"file","file":"Images/Intro/HoudiniFirstSteps/4_Export2.jpg","x":19522,"y":4598,"width":617,"height":333},
		{"id":"1e15c9aeabee022b","type":"text","text":"In `Stage/` network add:\n1. `ImportSop` Node for adding geometry from obj/geo/ network.\n2. `MaterialLibrary` Node for creating and assigning material.\n3. `PhysicalSky` Node for physically-based lighting\n4. `Camera` Node. Make sure to adjust camera position and paramters (selecting camera, locking camera, transforming, unlocking)\n5. `KarmaRenderer` Node for rendering. Make sure to adjust properties as required.","x":21248,"y":4284,"width":452,"height":371},
		{"id":"1d1c1643b8e915b3","type":"file","file":"Images/Intro/HoudiniFirstSteps/4_Export1.jpg","x":18874,"y":4598,"width":624,"height":336},
		{"id":"d3542db637a041d8","type":"text","text":"## Scene building, Karma rendering, Image processing\n\n- [Solaris and Karma](https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/solaris/index.html \"Solaris is the umbrella name for Houdini’s scene building, look development, and Karma rendering tools based on the Universal Scene Description (USD) framework.\")\n    \n    Solaris is the umbrella name for Houdini’s scene building, look development, and Karma rendering tools based on the Universal Scene Description (USD) framework.\n    \n- [Copernicus](https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/copernicus/index.html \"Houdini’s 2D and 3D GPU image processing framework.\")\n    \n    Houdini’s 2D and 3D GPU image processing framework.\n    \n- [Compositing](https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/composite/index.html \"Houdini’s compositing networks let you create and manipulate images such as renders.\")\n    \n    Houdini’s compositing networks let you create and manipulate images such as renders.\n    \n\n## Mantra rendering and shading [¶](https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/#mantra-rendering-and-shading)\n\n- [Mantra rendering](https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/render/index.html \"How to render images and animation with the Mantra engine.\")\n    \n    How to render images and animation with the Mantra engine.\n    \n- [Mantra materials](https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/shade/index.html \"How to assign materials and create custom materials for shading.\")\n    \n    How to assign materials and create custom materials for shading.","x":21425,"y":6676,"width":1052,"height":377},
		{"id":"9b46cb4c5308bd9b","type":"text","text":"UI:\n\n* Create project\n* Save file inside project\n* Check ENV variables in Edit -> Aliases and Variables...\n---\n* 3D viewport + manipulation (left side) + visualization (right side)\n* 3D viewport manipulation (left side)\n\t* 3D viewport camera icon\n\t* 3D viewport handle icon\n* 3D viewport visualization (right side)\n\t* Display options\n\t* Points\n\t* Normals\n* 3D viewport navigation:\n\t* LMB and drag\n\t* MMB and drag\n\t* Mouse wheel\n* Network pane\n* Network pane navigation:\n\t* MMB and drag\n\t* Mouse wheel\n* Parameter pane\n* Desktop presets\n* Shelves \n* Animation frame timeline\n---\n* Node selection \n* Node display\n* Node template\n* Node bypass\n* Node info\n* Node spreadsheet\n* Node selection vs Node display\n* Node cooking\n---\n*  ensure that network /obj/geo/ is selected\n\t* Scene view (3D viewport)\n\t* Network\n\t* Parameters","x":19709,"y":7360,"width":650,"height":1242},
		{"id":"102faf3299e885fa","type":"text","text":"Colors","x":19830,"y":1139,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2ef1b4e3e10bb528","type":"file","file":"Images/Intro/HoudiniFirstSteps/3_Geo_Process.jpg","x":19911,"y":2444,"width":1226,"height":659},
		{"id":"87193f3e3b8b2c24","type":"text","text":"Render 3D scene","x":20844,"y":3436,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5de1e2284667b3f7","type":"link","url":"https://polyhaven.com/","x":21340,"y":977,"width":700,"height":325},
		{"id":"b37bea75da29b0aa","type":"text","text":"Animation","x":19830,"y":1199,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"928a2bc3fa336596","type":"text","text":"Export 3D scene","x":19397,"y":3436,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0c44970b0c01c02c","type":"text","text":"Installing Houdini.\n\n1. Create free account.\n2. Install Launcher: https://www.sidefx.com/download/\n3. Install Houdini using Launcher\n4. Install Labs using Launcher\n5. Select Apprentice licence (free non-commercial)","x":20230,"y":-1943,"width":660,"height":286},
		{"id":"99855afc8c6785ae","type":"link","url":"https://www.sidefx.com/download/","x":20230,"y":-1603,"width":660,"height":556},
		{"id":"bc9265c303b73840","type":"text","text":"Houdini creates a directory where Houdini source file (.hip) will be stored as well as default directories for organizing work:\n* abc/\n* audio/\n* backup/\n* comp/\n* desk/\n* flip/\n* **geo/**\n* hda/\n* **render/**\n* scripts/\n* sim/\n* tex/\n* video/\n* HelloWorld.hip (this file is created later with Save as... option)","x":20945,"y":-949,"width":400,"height":532},
		{"id":"f36a9c27d4b8a97d","type":"text","text":"Create `geo/` network for creating and editing 3D models","x":20399,"y":1109,"width":250,"height":103},
		{"id":"1b05204d5b1080ba","type":"file","file":"Images/Intro/HoudiniFirstSteps/5_Render.png","x":21238,"y":5424,"width":924,"height":520},
		{"id":"1c46fc41a25c3115","type":"text","text":"Compositing and Post-Processing\n* Select Image Desktop\n* Select `img/` node\n* Inside `img/` node create `img/copnet/`","x":20209,"y":6264,"width":535,"height":160},
		{"id":"594ff54273224837","type":"text","text":"\n* Camera and light have to be added to `obj/` network\n* Materials have to be created in `obj/` network\n* Open `Output` Desktop preset\n* Select `out/` network\n* Create Mantra renderer\n* Configure Mantra renderer and render","x":20314,"y":3941,"width":325,"height":299},
		{"id":"5ca0493757b6e4d3","type":"link","url":"https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/render/render.html","x":20694,"y":4198,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"4e2635badae177be","type":"text","text":"Rendering via Karma/Solaris","x":21349,"y":3787,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3dd9a7f40d576c8b","type":"text","text":"Mantra renderer consists of multiple rendering paradigms :\n* Rasterization (Vulkan)\n* Ray-tracing\n* Physically-based rendering\n* Micropolygon rendering \n* Photon Map","x":20280,"y":4341,"width":395,"height":257},
		{"id":"0bf7aa71ed798dc0","type":"link","url":"https://www.sidefx.com/products/houdini/solaris/","x":21752,"y":3787,"width":725,"height":400},
